{
  "title": "Talent.Mcp overview",
  "uid": "talent-mcp-overview",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "tags": ["talent-mcp"],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Metric names, confirmed",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Panel queries use `talent_tool_duration_milliseconds_bucket`, `talent_tool_errors_total` and `talent_tasks_in_flight` — confirmed 4 Sep 2026 against a live OTel Collector 0.160.0 (`talent.tool.duration`/`talent.tool.errors`/`talent.tasks.in_flight` on the `Talent.Mcp` meter, sanitized by the `prometheusexporter`), see `docs/verification/otel-stack-versions.md` finding 5. If a future Collector upgrade changes the sanitization rules, re-derive with `curl http://localhost:8889/metrics | grep talent_` and fix these queries to match."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency per tool (p95)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ms" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, tool_name) (rate(talent_tool_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tool error rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tool_name) (rate(talent_tool_errors_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "bulk_score_shortlist tasks in flight",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "expr": "talent_tasks_in_flight",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
